  "rulesText": "An Arcane Focus takes one of the forms in the Arcane Focuses table and is be jeweled or carved to channel arcane magic. A Sorcerer, Warlock, or Wizard can use such an item as a Spellcasting Focus.\n\nArcane Focuses",
